<title>AUSTRIA: Qatar thinks OPEC will have one year output rollover.</title>
<headline>Qatar thinks OPEC will have one year output rollover.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qatari oil minister Abdullah bin Hamad al-Attiyah said he thought OPEC would agree a one year output rollover.</p>
<p>When assked if that would happen he said &quot;I think so.&quot;</p>
</text>
